# Keep the function bundle small and make sure nothing sensitive is uploaded.
#
# Only non-src, genuinely heavy or irrelevant paths are listed. All of src/ is
# kept deliberately: src/bot imports src.publisher.formatter, and trimming
# individual src/ subfolders to save a few KB of .py files risks an ImportError
# that only shows up at runtime, in production.
.github/
docs/
logs/
tools/
scripts/
baselines/
backgrounds/
telethon_session/
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.bot
docker-compose.yml
install_scheduled_task.ps1
start_simurg.bat
auth_telethon.py
*.md
.venv/
